# Root build context, used by diagnostics/gateway/Dockerfile and diagnostics/ui/Dockerfile:
# Directory.Build.props and global.json live here and so does contracts/, so neither image can
# be built from a per-stack context.
#
# **/obj/ is load-bearing rather than hygiene. Without it the source COPY overwrites the
# restore output produced inside the image with the host's, whose project.assets.json points
# at /home/<user>/.nuget — and `dotnet publish --no-restore` then fails with NETSDK1064
# "package was not found", which reads as a corrupt lock file and is not one.
.git
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.env
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
